{"id":"W45e4768a6057e11b90d6b4e7","zh":"特征(不利)波长","en":"","name":"特征(不利)波长","language":"zh","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","concept_id":"C1746ea1be5b2904aad97","families":[],"definition_zh":"与车体不利振动响应相关、需要从轨道不平顺中识别的特征波长。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":"用于轨道不平顺分析，识别其中能量较高或引起较强车体激振的空间周期，以关注与不利振动响应相关的不平顺成分。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W45e4768a6057e11b90d6b4e7","text":"特征(不利)波长","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S8fb32722437da8acfcfd","source_id":"P101","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"本文提出轨道不平顺特征(不利)波长自动提取算法:通过离散小波变换自适应提取轨道不平顺和车体振动响应各频段信号,对各信号进行 Wigner-Ville 和互 Wigner-Ville 时频能量分析,利用 Hough 变换抑制多分量信号 WignerVille 变换中的交叉干扰项,导出了轨道不平顺特征(不利)波长提取公式。","citations":[{"source_id":"P101","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sc025a1409f5e47c8b520","source_id":"P101","page":7,"page_end":7,"language":"zh","text":"(1) 轨道不平顺或车体振动响应空间序列经离散小波分频段处理后,在 Wigner-Ville 时-频能量分布中以不同频率尺度上近似平行的状线存在,采用 Hough 变换提取特征(不利)波长的基础。","citations":[{"source_id":"P101","page":7,"page_end":7}]}],"sources":{"P101":{"id":"P101","title":"基于小波和Wigner-Hough变换的轨道特征不平顺联合分析","authors":"徐磊；陈宪麦","year":"2014","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2014.05.015","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2014）","overview_slug":"2014-wavelet-wigner-hough-track-irregularity"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[],"word_links":[{"id":"W0b7b4e5e1966770f5e1b36d5","name":"characteristic (detrimental) wavelength","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W0b7b4e5e1966770f5e1b36d5","name":"characteristic (detrimental) wavelength","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W0b7b4e5e1966770f5e1b36d5","name":"characteristic (detrimental) wavelength","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P101","title":"基于小波和Wigner-Hough变换的轨道特征不平顺联合分析","authors":"徐磊；陈宪麦","year":"2014","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2014.05.015","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2014）","overview_slug":"2014-wavelet-wigner-hough-track-irregularity"}]}